{"quest_id": 6318, "name": "まどろみの来訪者", "description": "王国を訪れた眠たげな女性。\nまどろみながらも王子を探す、\n彼女の目的とは……？\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "夢現のダークプリースト", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920100, "map_no": 3255, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 15, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 21, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 36}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "level": 90, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 81}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 100}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？\n", "text": "……ふぅ。ここが王国ね。\n早くあの方々にお会いして助けを求めなくちゃ。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "それにしても、この辺りは長閑で気持ちいいわねぇ。\nふわぁ……なんだか眠くなっちゃった。\nうとうと、うとうと……。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "…………ニンゲン？", "face": "l92f1bb333087"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "――きゃっ！\nご、ごめんなさい。わざとぶつかったんじゃないの。\n景色を見ながら歩いてたら、つい眠くなって――", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "――って、きゃあぁあッ！！　ま、魔物――ッ！！", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャッ！　ニンゲン、ヤッツケル！", "face": "l92f1bb333087"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは――！\n王子、魔物に人が襲われています！　\nすぐに救護いたしましょう！", "face": "lae227901722d"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？\n", "text": "……あ、ありがとうございます。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "ベルナール", "text": "なに、礼には及ばん。\n困っている者を助けるのは当然のことだ。", "face": "u10"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "まぁ……なんとお優しい方なのでしょう！\nそれに、そのどことなく気品溢れる出で立ち。\nひょっとして、貴方が噂の王子さまですか？", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "ベルナール", "text": "おぉ……この武具の美しさがわかるとは！\n実にお目が高い！　お嬢さん、お名前はなんと――", "face": "u10"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ベルナールさん、話をややこしくしないでください。\n……そちらの方、王子はこちらですよ。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "あら～、そうなんですか～。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "――って、それどころではありません！\n王子さま、私は貴方にお願いがあって来たのです。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "？？？\n", "text": "お願いします、\nどうか魔物に襲われた村をお救いください。\n私一人の力では、もう……。", "face": "u558"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "村が魔物に？\nそのお話、ぜひ詳しく伺わせてください。", "face": "lae227901722d"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920100_3255", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 947, "y": 314}, {"k": "m", "x": 848, "y": 324, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 781, "y": 373, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 709, "y": 416, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 620, "y": 448, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 428, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 438, "y": 385, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 346, "y": 340, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 280, "y": 286, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 307, "y": 213, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 378, "y": 178, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 452, "y": 149, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 536, "